## Change map

| Change type | Update |
|-------------|--------|
| Product scope | PRD, SRS, user-flows |
| API route / validation | apiSpec, openapi.yaml, SRS, TDD |
| Schema / RLS / status rules | erd, state-machines, openapi (if DTO changes), TDD |
| Architecture / deploy | c4, overview |
| UX screen behavior | user-flows, browse/adopt detail docs, ux-ui-rules |

## Rules

- README `## Documentation` links to docs/README.md
- OpenAPI and apiSpec must stay aligned
- Keep mermaid node IDs without spaces

## Source of truth

- Endpoints: `src/backend/src/index.ts`
- Routes: `src/frontend/src/App.tsx`
- Schema: `src/backend/supabase/schema.sql`
